euthydemus-knowing.logic.r2: argue/two-senses: P4 (S5): "knowing" is taken as knowing without qualification, i.e. knowing all things in P4 P7 and as a knower, i.e. one who knows some things where knowing is used else, a reader says
euthydemus-knowing.logic.r2: argue/two-senses: P4 (S5): it takes "knowing" from a knower of some things to one who knows all things, a reader says
